  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrowhead embeds itself in the bony iliac crest of your hip, causing a minor fracture to the ilium bone of the pelvis. Although painful every time you put your weight on the leg on that side, it’ll heal of itself in time.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test or gain @Condition[Stunned] (1). Regardless you’ll suffer a -1 penalty to your M, which will last until the bone has mended in 30 minus your Toughness Bonus days. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Easy)</strong> will be required for Extraction.</p>"
